      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: The descriptions in this section are slightly oblique. I think the behavior we\u0027re talking about here is most directly described in the USB 3.2 Gen2 branch of Figure 5-1, the TBT Gen3 rows of Table 5-1 (including footnote 3), and ss 5.4.3.3 (describing the cable speed and cable type fields of the EUDO).",
